 "text": "Encapsulated coils\n\nThe electromagnet coils, encapsulated in epoxy resin, have a high dielectric strength and maximum magnetic efficiency due to their design and mechanical construction.\n\nExplore subcategories\nRound\nRound reels with central through hole for smooth or stepped shafts. With different cable outlet lengths and designed to withstand the most demanding vibrations. What are electromagnet coils? Electromagnet coils are an electromagnetic component consisting of a spirally wound conductive wire, designed to generate a magnetic field when an electric current is applied to it. This field allows attracting or moving metallic objects in a controlled manner, which makes it a key element in lifting systems, industrial automation, electromagnetic brakes and magnetic locks.\nLearn more\nSquares\nTorivac electromagnet coils are manufactured with high quality materials, designed to ensure reliable performance even in demanding industrial environments. Each unit is produced under strict insulation and encapsulation controls, ensuring excellent dielectric strength and long service life.\nLearn more\n\nTorivac-Products\n\n×\n\nProducts\n\nTransformers\n\n+\n\nConventional transformer\n\nToroidal transformers\n\nVoltage variators - Adjustable autotransformers\n\n+\n\nCustom manufacturing\n\nDesktop equipment\n\nDouble Variator\n\nRegulating accessories\n\nSingle Phase Inverters\n\nThree-phase drives\n\nVoltage stabilizers\n\n+\n\nAVS Series Stabilizers: electromechanical with servo motor\n\nBAVS Series: Electronics\n\nRheostats and coiled potentiometers\n\n+\n\nCeramic rheostats\n\nPotentiometers\n\nEncapsulated coils\n\n+\n\nRound\n\nSquares\n\nChokes | Inductances | Toroidal Reactances\n\n+\n\nNuclei\n\n+\n\nPortaled\n\n+\n\nled 10mm\n\nled 3mm\n\nled 5mm\n\nled 8mm\n\nSockets\n\n+\n\nHB4 socket\n\nHSR4 safety socket\n\nSafety socket HBS4\n\nsafety socket HR4\n\nControl buttons\n\n+\n\nArrow Discs\n\nArrow hoops\n\nBM series control buttons (Matte)\n\nBM 